        {
          "title": "Identify its actual gradient",
          "text": "The real Riesz isometry and true continuous-linear derivative show gradientf is constanta. It therefore has genuine weighted vectorL2.",
          "formula": "\\nabla f_a(x)=a,\\quad\\nabla f_a\\in L^2(\\mu).",
